{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S03、S11、S12等短段落里仍安排了较多叙述和感受提示，即使分时出现，也可能让观众来不及逐条捕捉；Y的左右分栏在这些段落更容易快速扫过。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用加亮短语建立了清楚的叙事主干，观众即使不逐字阅读，也容易抓住每段人物念头的变化；感受文字较小且随音乐分时出现，又能把细微的情绪和音乐变化对应起来。尤其从舍不得、孤独、两头放不下，到不再逼自己选边、带着想念继续生活，X把人物的心理因果和前后发展交代得更完整。Y的左右分栏确实便于快速浏览，但右侧短词较多地并列呈现，容易成为感受标签的集合，不如X容易看出情绪如何发生、转变和消退。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3e7256fa-8832-44fe-aff2-095cc147d167", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T002201587090Z", "elapsed_seconds": 119.531, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:24:01.141377+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0ef29b4ddc979115aea97d737aae3da534c5d71aae5115db89ca52f176b5fb41", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31